OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1785518372
OL,3,CSaltburn cricketer accused of cheating
OL,4,Cafter footage goes viral
OL,6,FThe North Yorkshire and South Durham
OL,7,FCricket League is investigating
OL,8,Fallegations of cheating after a
OL,9,FSaltburn fielder was accused of
OL,10,Fclicking his fingers to get a caught-
OL,11,Fbehind wicket.
OL,13,FA video on social media, which has
OL,14,Fgone viral, appears to show the
OL,15,Ffielder click his fingers as the ball
OL,16,Fpasses Norton batter Noman Shabir's
OL,17,Fbat before being caught by
OL,18,Fwicketkeeper Josh Bowes.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/4
