PN,39903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1785518372
OL,3,CSaltburn cricketer accused of cheating
OL,4,Cafter footage goes viral
OL,6,F"A full investigation has been
OL,7,Finitiated and until such time as the
OL,8,Fformal processes are complete no
OL,9,Ffurther comment will be made."
OL,11,FIn response to a post on social media
OL,12,Fshowing the video, Middlesbrough's
OL,13,Fsecond XI captain Rory Cotterill has
OL,14,Fclaimed there were two more incidents
OL,15,Fof cheating in his side's 29-run
OL,16,Fdefeat to Saltburn last month.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@^O]
